iting, 3D and gaming\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Nimbus 13\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Everything you need, for less\",\n    \"price\": 999,\n    \"weightKg\": 1,\n    \"batteryH\": 22,\n    \"screen\": \"13\\\" IPS\",\n    \"cpu\": \"6-core, 15 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 16,\n    \"storageGb\": 256,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"headphone\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.2,\n    \"reviews\": 2310,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Lightest\",\n      \"Best battery life\",\n      \"Lowest price\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Dimmer screen\",\n      \"Small SSD\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Students and light office work\"\n  }\n]","systemHash":"dcc43620444bd5561aa7a57e09f50adaace10b9cc1a0c5f2f824f41f6ed0f15b","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n.compare-scroll{overflow-x:auto}.compare-table{min-width:760px;width:100%;table-layout:fixed}.compare-table th:first-child{width:19%}.compare-table th,.compare-table td{text-align:left;vertical-align:top}.compare-table ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}.pick{border:2px solid #638572}.product-price{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:750;margin:12px 0}.verdict{margin-top:12px}.compare-table caption{text-align:left;margin-bottom:16px}.nowrap{white-space:nowrap}\n</style>\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Laptop comparison</span>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">3 laptops · $999–$1,899</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Find your right fit.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Compare portability, power and price—then choose the laptop that fits your day.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\" aria-labelledby=\"priority-title\">\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <h2 class=\"h3\" id=\"priority-title\">What matters most to you?</h2>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Quick recommendation</span>\n    </div>\n    <label>Choose your priority\n      <select id=\"priority\">\n        <option value=\"everyday\">Travel and everyday work</option>\n        <option value=\"power\">Video editing, 3D and gaming</option>\n        <option value=\"value\">Students, value and battery life</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n    <p id=\"recommendation\" aria-live=\"polite\"><strong>Pick Aero 14.</strong> Its 14″ OLED, 1.2 kg weight and 18-hour battery make it a balanced travel companion. It costs $300 more than Nimbus 13.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Laptop overview\">\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pick\" id=\"aero-card\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h2 class=\"h2\">Aero 14</h2><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Highest rated</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n      <div class=\"product-price\">$1,299</div>\n      <p><strong>4.6 / 5</strong> <span class=\"small muted\">· 1,840 reviews</span></p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Weight</span><strong>1.2 kg</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Battery</span><strong>18 hours</strong></div>\n      <p class=\"small verdict\"><strong>Best for</strong><br>Travel and everyday work</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\" id=\"forge-card\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h2 class=\"h2\">Forge 16</h2><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Most powerful</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n      <div class=\"product-price\">$1,899</div>\n      <p><strong>4.4 / 5</strong> <span class=\"small muted\">· 960 reviews</span></p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Weight</span><strong>2.1 kg</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Battery</span><strong>9 hours</strong></div>\n      <p class=\"small verdict\"><strong>Best for</strong><br>Video editing, 3D and gaming</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\" id=\"nimbus-card\">\n      <div class=\"row between\"><h2 class=\"h2\">Nimbus 13</h2><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Lowest price</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n      <div class=\"product-price\">$999</div>\n      <p><strong>4.2 / 5</strong> <span class=\"small muted\">· 2,310 reviews</span></p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Weight</span><strong>1 kg</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Battery</span><strong>22 hours</strong></div>\n      <p class=\"small verdict\"><strong>Best for</strong><br>Students and light office work</p>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\" aria-labelledby=\"specs-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"specs-title\">The details, side by side</h2>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Compare the hardware and the compromises—not just the price.</p>\n    <div class=\"compare-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Laptop specifications\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      <table class=\"table compare-table\">\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Specification</th><th scope=\"col\">Aero 14</th><th scope=\"col\">Forge 16</th><th scope=\"col\">Nimbus 13</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Display</th><td>14″ OLED</td><td>16″ IPS 165Hz</td><td>13″ IPS</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Processor</th><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td>16-core, 55 W</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">RAM</th><td>16 GB</td><td><strong>32 GB</strong></td><td>16 GB</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Storage</th><td>512 GB</td><td><strong>1,024 GB</strong></td><td>256 GB</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Ports</th><td>2× USB-C<br>HDMI<br>Headphone</td><td>2× USB-C<br>3× USB-A<br>HDMI<br>Ethernet<br>SD card</td><td>2× USB-C<br>Headphone</td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Strengths</th><td><ul><li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li><li>Great battery</li><li>Quiet under load</li></ul></td><td><ul><li>Fastest of the three</li><li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li><li>Full port selection</li></ul></td><td><ul><li>Lightest</li><li>Best battery life</li><li>Lowest price</li></ul></td></tr>\n          <tr><th scope=\"row\">Trade-offs</th><td><ul><li>Soldered RAM</li><li>Glossy screen</li></ul></td><td><ul><li>Heavy</li><li>Fans are audible</li></ul></td><td><ul><li>Dimmer screen</li><li>Small SSD</li></ul></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Battery comparison and buying guidance\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">More time away from an outlet</h2>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14 · 18 h\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16 · 9 h\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13 · 22 h\",\"value\":22}]}'></div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Nimbus lasts 4 hours longer than Aero and 13 hours longer than Forge, based on the supplied figures. Actual runtime varies with use.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">Make the trade-off that suits you</h2>\n      <p><strong>Aero 14 → Better everyday balance.</strong><br><span class=\"muted\">Spend $300 over Nimbus for an OLED screen and twice the storage, with 0.2 kg more weight and 4 fewer battery hours.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <p><strong>Forge 16 → Power over portability.</strong><br><span class=\"muted\">Spend $600 over Aero for twice the RAM and storage, upgradeability and more ports. Carry 0.9 kg more and get half the battery life.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <p><strong>Nimbus 13 → Less cost, less to carry.</strong><br><span class=\"muted\">The lightest and longest-lasting option. Choose it if a dimmer display and 256 GB SSD are acceptable compromises.</span></p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var select=document.getElementById('priority');\n  var choices={\n    everyday:{id:'aero-card',text:'<strong>Pick Aero 14.</strong> Its 14″ OLED, 1.2 kg weight and 18-hour battery make it a balanced travel companion. It costs $300 more than Nimbus 13.'},\n    power:{id:'forge-card',text:'<strong>Pick Forge 16.</strong> The fastest of the three, with 32 GB RAM, 1,024 GB storage and upgradeable RAM and SSD. Budget for its $1,899 price, 2.1 kg weight and 9-hour battery.'},\n    value:{id:'nimbus-card',text:'<strong>Pick Nimbus 13.</strong> At $999 and 1 kg, it is the cheapest and lightest, with the longest battery life at 22 hours. The trade-offs are a dimmer screen and a smaller 256 GB SSD.'}\n  };\n  select.addEventListener('change',function(){\n    var choice=choices[this.value];\n    document.getElementById('recommendation').innerHTML=choice.text;\n    ['aero-card','forge-card','nimbus-card'].forEach(function(id){document.getElementById(id).classList.toggle('pick',id===choice.id);});\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[2958,"<style"],[2958,">\n"],[2958,".compare"],[3174,"-scroll"],[3292,"{"],[3292,"overflow"],[3292,"-x"],[3292,":auto"],[3292,"}."],[3423,"compare"],[3425,"-table"],[3425,"{"],[3425,"min"],[3425,"-width"],[3425,":"],[3425,"760"],[3425,"px"],[3425,";width"],[3425,":"],[3425,"100"],[3425,"%;"],[3583,"table"],[3584,"-layout"],[3584,":"],[3584,"fixed"],[3584,"}."],[3584,"compare"],[3584,"-table"],[3584," th"],[3584,":first"],[3584,"-child"],[3584,"{"],[3584,"width"],[3691,":"],[3691,"19"],[3691,"%"],[3691,"}."],[3691,"compare"],[3691,"-table"],[3691," th"],[3691,",."],[3691,"compare"],[3691,"-table"],[3691," td"],[3691,"{text"],[3691,"-align"],[3691,":left"],[3691,";"],[3691,"vertical"],[3694,"-align"],[3694,":"],[3694,"top"],[3694,"}."],[3694,"compare"],[3694,"-table"],[3694," ul"],[3694,"{"],[3909,"margin"],[4004,":"],[4004,"0"],[4004,";padding"],[4004,"-left"